  "description": "The village of Drimoleague is located near Dunmanway and Bantry in County Cork. There is a nice footpath running along the River Ruagagh through the village. Good local walking options include the popular Sheeps Head Way a coastal loop walk located between Bantry Bay and Dunmanus Bay. You could also head to Glandore where there's a lovely harbour and the ancient Drombeg Stone Circle to explore. Please scroll down for the full list of walks near and around Drimoleague. The detailed maps below also show a range of footpaths, bridleways and cycle paths in the area.",
